    257 to """On a day of Earthquake aligned with Sunrise, people feel deeply attuned to both inner dreams and outer realities—eager to savor life’s simple pleasures while remaining aware of challenges. They should embrace their imagination and joy in small things, but not avoid serious problems, as suppressing them may lead to emotional eruptions. To thrive, they must balance fantasy with action, using their creativity to inspire change rather than escape it.""",
    258 to """On the day of Flint rising toward the Dawn, people feel a powerful drive to act independently, combining inner strength and unwavering determination with a pragmatic, forward-thinking mindset. They should focus on staying true to their principles while embracing flexibility to avoid conflicts born from rigidity; it’s best to speak honestly but with awareness of others’ feelings. Avoid suppressing your natural assertiveness or compromising your values for convenience—let your authenticity and efficiency guide you toward meaningful success.""",
